  - thermodynamics
abstract: >-
  Open-source model of a triethylene glycol (TEG) dehydration unit for a coal-seam gas stream:
  a steady-state DWSIM model with Peng-Robinson parameters calibrated to public data, a design
  sensitivity study, and a reduced-order dynamic Modelica model exported as an FMI 2.0 FMU for
  control studies.
